Narrator: Welcome to the world of Slimetopia, On this warm sunny day there's something a miss. 
Narrator: All of your animal friends have fallen out! Go MEET all the animals and see if you can help them!
Narrator: Player 1 - Movement: WASD, BigSuck: Q, Interact: E, ChargeJump: Hold Space
Narrator: Player 2 - Movement Arrow Keys, BigSuck: R Ctrl, Interact: Return/Enter. ChargeJump: Hold Right Shift
